1. PARTIES
THIS PROPRIETARY SOFTWARE LICENSE AGREEMENT ("AGREEMENT") IS BETWEEN RYAN LU ("LICENSOR") AND ANY INDIVIDUAL, TEAM, ORGANIZATION, BUSINESS, OR OTHER ENTITY THAT ACCESSES, INSTALLS, COPIES, RECEIVES, USES, OR OTHERWISE OBTAINS THE SOFTWARE ("LICENSEE" OR "YOU").

2. SOFTWARE
"SOFTWARE" MEANS ALL SOFTWARE, SOURCE CODE, OBJECT CODE, BINARIES, EXECUTABLES, SCRIPTS, MODULES, COMPONENTS, LIBRARIES, APIS, TOOLS, FEATURES, FUNCTIONALITY, USER INTERFACES, DATABASE SCHEMAS, CONFIGURATIONS, DOCUMENTATION, RELATED MATERIALS, AND ANY UPDATES, ENHANCEMENTS, MODIFICATIONS, DERIVATIVE WORKS, OR COPIES OF ANY OF THE FOREGOING PROVIDED BY OR ON BEHALF OF LICENSOR.

3. OWNERSHIP
THE SOFTWARE IS PROPRIETARY, CONFIDENTIAL, AND CLOSED SOURCE. THE SOFTWARE IS LICENSED, NOT SOLD. AS BETWEEN LICENSOR AND ALL LICENSEES, LICENSOR OWNS AND SHALL RETAIN ALL RIGHT, TITLE, AND INTEREST IN AND TO THE SOFTWARE, INCLUDING ALL COPYRIGHTS, TRADE SECRET RIGHTS, TRADEMARK RIGHTS, PATENT RIGHTS, MASK WORK RIGHTS, MORAL RIGHTS, AND ALL OTHER INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND PROPRIETARY RIGHTS IN OR RELATING TO THE SOFTWARE. NO OWNERSHIP RIGHT, TITLE, OR INTEREST IN THE SOFTWARE IS TRANSFERRED TO ANY LICENSEE BY VIRTUE OF ACCESS TO, RECEIPT OF, OR USE OF THE SOFTWARE. NO IMPLIED LICENSES ARE GRANTED.

4. AUTHORIZED LICENSEES ONLY
THE SOFTWARE MAY BE LICENSED BY LICENSOR, IN LICENSOR'S SOLE DISCRETION, TO DARE AQUATICS AND/OR TO OTHER TEAMS, ORGANIZATIONS, BUSINESSES, OR INDIVIDUALS ONLY IF AND TO THE EXTENT EXPRESSLY APPROVED BY LICENSOR.

NO PERSON OR ENTITY IS AN AUTHORIZED LICENSEE UNLESS AND UNTIL ALL OF THE FOLLOWING HAVE OCCURRED:
(A) LICENSOR HAS GIVEN PRIOR EXPRESS WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION OR ENTERED INTO A SEPARATE WRITTEN LICENSE OR OTHER WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION;
(B) THE PERSON OR ENTITY HAS AGREED TO BE BOUND BY THIS AGREEMENT AND ANY APPLICABLE ADDITIONAL LICENSE TERMS BEFORE ANY ACCESS TO OR USE OF THE SOFTWARE; AND
(C) THE PERSON OR ENTITY OTHERWISE REMAINS IN FULL COMPLIANCE WITH THIS AGREEMENT.

ANY PERSON OR ENTITY THAT DOES NOT SATISFY ALL OF THE FOREGOING CONDITIONS HAS NO RIGHT TO ACCESS OR USE THE SOFTWARE FOR ANY PURPOSE.

5. LIMITED LICENSE
SUBJECT TO STRICT COMPLIANCE WITH THIS AGREEMENT AND ANY SEPARATE WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION FROM LICENSOR, LICENSOR MAY GRANT TO AN AUTHORIZED LICENSEE A LIMITED, REVOCABLE, NON-EXCLUSIVE, NON-TRANSFERABLE, NON-ASSIGNABLE, NON-SUBLICENSABLE LICENSE TO USE THE SOFTWARE SOLELY FOR THE INTERNAL BUSINESS OPERATIONS OR INTERNAL TEAM PURPOSES EXPRESSLY APPROVED BY LICENSOR.

NO LICENSE GRANTED UNDER THIS AGREEMENT INCLUDES ANY RIGHT TO:
(A) MODIFY THE SOFTWARE, EXCEPT WITH LICENSOR'S PRIOR EXPRESS WRITTEN PERMISSION;
(B) DISTRIBUTE THE SOFTWARE TO ANY THIRD PARTY;
(C) PROVIDE, ENABLE, SUPPORT, OR OPERATE ANY HOSTED, MANAGED, SERVICE BUREAU, TIME-SHARING, OR SOFTWARE-AS-A-SERVICE OFFERING;
(D) COMMERCIALIZE, SELL, RESELL, WHITE-LABEL, OR OTHERWISE EXPLOIT THE SOFTWARE EXCEPT TO THE EXTENT EXPRESSLY APPROVED IN WRITING BY LICENSOR; OR
(E) USE THE SOFTWARE OUTSIDE THE SCOPE EXPRESSLY AUTHORIZED BY LICENSOR.

ANY MODIFICATION PERMITTED BY LICENSOR SHALL REMAIN THE EXCLUSIVE PROPERTY OF LICENSOR, INCLUDING ALL INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS THEREIN, UNLESS LICENSOR EXPRESSLY AGREES OTHERWISE IN A SEPARATE SIGNED WRITING.

6. RESTRICTIONS
EXCEPT TO THE EXTENT EXPRESSLY AUTHORIZED BY LICENSOR IN A SEPARATE WRITTEN AGREEMENT OR OTHER PRIOR WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION, YOU SHALL NOT, AND SHALL NOT PERMIT OR ASSIST ANY THIRD PARTY TO:

(A) ACCESS OR USE THE SOFTWARE WITHOUT BEING AN AUTHORIZED LICENSEE;
(B) COPY, REPRODUCE, MODIFY, ADAPT, ALTER, TRANSLATE, PORT, OR CREATE DERIVATIVE WORKS OF THE SOFTWARE;
(C) DISTRIBUTE, DISCLOSE, PUBLISH, DISPLAY, TRANSMIT, ASSIGN, TRANSFER, SELL, RESELL, LICENSE, SUBLICENSE, RENT, LEASE, LEND, OR OTHERWISE MAKE THE SOFTWARE AVAILABLE TO ANY THIRD PARTY;
(D) USE THE SOFTWARE TO PROVIDE, ENABLE, SUPPORT, OR OPERATE ANY HOSTED, MANAGED, SERVICE BUREAU, TIME-SHARING, OR SOFTWARE-AS-A-SERVICE OFFERING;
(E) REVERSE ENGINEER, DECOMPILE, DISASSEMBLE, DECRYPT, DECODE, OR OTHERWISE ATTEMPT TO DERIVE, DISCOVER, OR RECONSTRUCT ANY SOURCE CODE, ALGORITHMS, STRUCTURE, SEQUENCE, ORGANIZATION, IDEAS, METHODS, OR UNDERLYING TECHNOLOGY OF THE SOFTWARE, EXCEPT ONLY TO THE EXTENT SUCH RESTRICTION IS PROHIBITED BY APPLICABLE LAW;
(F) REMOVE, ALTER, OR OBSCURE ANY COPYRIGHT, TRADEMARK, CONFIDENTIALITY, PROPRIETARY, OR OTHER LEGAL NOTICE;
(G) CIRCUMVENT, DISABLE, OR INTERFERE WITH ANY SECURITY FEATURE, ACCESS CONTROL, LICENSE CONTROL, OR TECHNICAL LIMITATION OF THE SOFTWARE;
(H) BENCHMARK THE SOFTWARE OR PUBLISH, DISCLOSE, OR SHARE ANY PERFORMANCE, SECURITY, OR FUNCTIONAL TEST RESULTS WITHOUT LICENSOR'S PRIOR WRITTEN CONSENT;
(I) USE THE SOFTWARE IN ANY MANNER THAT VIOLATES APPLICABLE LAW OR INFRINGES, MISAPPROPRIATES, OR OTHERWISE VIOLATES ANY RIGHTS OF LICENSOR OR ANY THIRD PARTY; OR
(J) ACCESS OR USE THE SOFTWARE BEYOND THE SCOPE OF THE LICENSE EXPRESSLY GRANTED BY LICENSOR.

7. CLOSED-SOURCE; NO SOURCE CODE DISCLOSURE
THE SOFTWARE IS CLOSED SOURCE. NO RIGHT TO RECEIVE, ACCESS, REVIEW, POSSESS, OR USE ANY SOURCE CODE IS GRANTED EXCEPT TO THE EXTENT LICENSOR EXPRESSLY AGREES IN A SEPARATE WRITTEN AGREEMENT OR OTHER PRIOR WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION.

8. CONFIDENTIALITY
THE SOFTWARE, INCLUDING ITS SOURCE CODE, OBJECT CODE, DESIGN, STRUCTURE, ORGANIZATION, USER INTERFACES, NON-PUBLIC FEATURES, DOCUMENTATION, TECHNICAL INFORMATION, BUSINESS INFORMATION, AND ALL NON-PUBLIC MATERIALS RELATING TO THE SOFTWARE, CONSTITUTES LICENSOR'S CONFIDENTIAL AND PROPRIETARY INFORMATION.

YOU SHALL:
(A) HOLD ALL SUCH INFORMATION IN STRICT CONFIDENCE;
(B) NOT DISCLOSE IT TO ANY THIRD PARTY EXCEPT AS EXPRESSLY AUTHORIZED IN WRITING BY LICENSOR;
(C) USE IT ONLY AS EXPRESSLY PERMITTED UNDER YOUR LICENSE; AND
(D) USE AT LEAST REASONABLE CARE, AND IN NO EVENT LESS THAN THE CARE YOU USE TO PROTECT YOUR OWN MOST SENSITIVE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION, TO PREVENT UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS, USE, OR DISCLOSURE.

9. NO PATENT LICENSE
NO EXPRESS OR IMPLIED LICENSE OR IMMUNITY IS GRANTED UNDER ANY PATENT OR PATENT APPLICATION OF LICENSOR OR ANY THIRD PARTY.

10. FEEDBACK
IF YOU PROVIDE LICENSOR WITH ANY FEEDBACK, SUGGESTIONS, IDEAS, ENHANCEMENTS, OR RECOMMENDATIONS RELATING TO THE SOFTWARE ("FEEDBACK"), LICENSOR MAY USE, DISCLOSE, REPRODUCE, LICENSE, DISTRIBUTE, AND OTHERWISE EXPLOIT SUCH FEEDBACK WITHOUT RESTRICTION AND WITHOUT ANY OBLIGATION, ACCOUNTING, OR COMPENSATION TO YOU.

11. TERM
THIS AGREEMENT BEGINS WHEN YOU FIRST ACCESS, INSTALL, COPY, RECEIVE, USE, OR OTHERWISE OBTAIN THE SOFTWARE AND CONTINUES UNTIL TERMINATED.

12. TERMINATION
ANY ACTUAL OR ATTEMPTED BREACH OF THIS AGREEMENT, ANY ACCESS OR USE OF THE SOFTWARE WITHOUT PROPER AUTHORIZATION, OR ANY USE OF THE SOFTWARE OUTSIDE THE SCOPE OF AN APPLICABLE LICENSE SHALL AUTOMATICALLY AND IMMEDIATELY TERMINATE ALL RIGHTS GRANTED TO YOU, WITHOUT NOTICE.

LICENSOR MAY ALSO TERMINATE ANY LICENSE OR AUTHORIZATION AT ANY TIME TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW.

UPON TERMINATION OR UPON LICENSOR'S WRITTEN REQUEST, YOU SHALL IMMEDIATELY:
(A) CEASE ALL ACCESS TO AND USE OF THE SOFTWARE;
(B) DELETE, DESTROY, OR RETURN ALL COPIES OF THE SOFTWARE AND ALL RELATED MATERIALS IN YOUR POSSESSION, CUSTODY, OR CONTROL; AND
(C) UPON REQUEST, CERTIFY IN WRITING THAT YOU HAVE FULLY COMPLIED WITH THIS SECTION.

