TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, YOU SHALL DEFEND, INDEMNIFY, AND HOLD HARMLESS LICENSOR AND LICENSOR'S AFFILIATES, SUCCESSORS, ASSIGNS, REPRESENTATIVES, AND AGENTS FROM AND AGAINST ANY AND ALL CLAIMS, DEMANDS, ACTIONS, PROCEEDINGS, DAMAGES, LOSSES, LIABILITIES, JUDGMENTS, SETTLEMENTS, COSTS, AND EXPENSES, INCLUDING REASONABLE ATTORNEYS' FEES, ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING TO:
(A) YOUR ACCESS TO OR USE OF THE SOFTWARE;
(B) YOUR BREACH OF THIS AGREEMENT;
(C) YOUR VIOLATION OF APPLICABLE LAW; OR
(D) YOUR INFRINGEMENT, MISAPPROPRIATION, OR OTHER VIOLATION OF ANY RIGHTS OF ANY PERSON OR ENTITY.

16. EQUITABLE RELIEF
YOU ACKNOWLEDGE THAT ANY BREACH OF THIS AGREEMENT MAY CAUSE IRREPARABLE HARM TO LICENSOR FOR WHICH MONETARY DAMAGES MAY BE AN INADEQUATE REMEDY. ACCORDINGLY, LICENSOR SHALL BE ENTITLED TO SEEK TEMPORARY, PRELIMINARY, AND PERMANENT INJUNCTIVE RELIEF, SPECIFIC PERFORMANCE, AND OTHER EQUITABLE RELIEF, IN ADDITION TO ANY OTHER RIGHTS OR REMEDIES AVAILABLE AT LAW OR IN EQUITY, WITHOUT THE NECESSITY OF POSTING BOND TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW.

17. COMPLIANCE WITH LAWS; EXPORT
YOU SHALL COMPLY WITH ALL APPLICABLE LAWS, RULES, AND REGULATIONS IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE. YOU SHALL NOT ACCESS, USE, EXPORT, RE-EXPORT, RELEASE, OR TRANSFER THE SOFTWARE IN VIOLATION OF ANY APPLICABLE EXPORT CONTROL, SANCTIONS, OR TRADE LAWS OR REGULATIONS.

